## Generated PDFs (temporary staging - production PDFs should be in configured output location)
**/temp-pdfs/
**/staging-pdfs/

## Project-specific exclusions
# Keep database scripts in source control
!database/**/*.sql

# Keep .specify configuration
!.specify/

# Keep GitHub workflows
!.github/
